# Project context

Before substantial design or implementation changes, use the documents in `docs/` as the project source of truth.

Read `docs/00_VISION.md` through `docs/09_CURRENT_AP_REFERENCE.md` in numeric order when starting a new major task, then consult `docs/99_SOURCES.md` when claims about partners, security or contractual terminology matter.

Key principles:
- A&P is proactive managed IT, not break/fix support.
- `docs/09_CURRENT_AP_REFERENCE.md` is the current baseline, not content that must be published unchanged.
- Preserve the futuristic game-HUD visual direction in `docs/06_VISUAL_AND_INTERACTION_DIRECTION.md`.
- Do not turn unverified/open items into public claims.
- Keep components, content and motion modular so the site can evolve without redesigning the whole codebase.
